{"id": "official:sentence:1da25a85-10a3-43a6-9f65-6e804b26160c", "text": "我是在网上卖的衣服。", "shortMeaning": "我的衣服是在网上卖的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0e3947df-aa64-45c8-9a16-f197e987127c", "text": "我是在食堂吃的饭。", "shortMeaning": "我是在食堂吃的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8ad1ae3-f243-4a44-b826-5471bf912281", "text": "我是外国人，我捷克语不好，请说慢一点。", "shortMeaning": "我是外国人，捷克语不好，请说慢点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d71c981-db0a-4c65-b925-44584c88dc7d", "text": "我是女人。我叫伊娃。", "shortMeaning": "我是女人，叫伊娃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ed080d9-f47f-45c9-96c3-4c1626d55a6e", "text": "我是她的，而她是我的。", "shortMeaning": "我是她的，她是我的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:190bff6e-5029-4628-955f-c48d04b04c57", "text": "我是我们办公室的头儿。", "shortMeaning": "我是办公室的头儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9c67853-7a14-47c4-a2bd-576f352994d9", "text": "我是据我所知最懒的人。", "shortMeaning": "据我所知我是最懒的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:540d5e44-52c6-4b39-9c28-8c165e131bdc", "text": "我是日本人，但不住在日本。", "shortMeaning": "我是日本人，但不住日本。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d30fb66-ab9b-42ce-becc-6f283ecb6aeb", "text": "我是日本人，而你是美国人。", "shortMeaning": "我是日本人，你是美国人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b52ece8-c398-4994-a26b-fd1f47eabbde", "text": "我是法国籍的，但我是越南人。", "shortMeaning": "我虽是法国籍，却是越南人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2164a29e-3d35-4ef1-b94e-304c56360bcb", "text": "我是演员，不是模特。", "shortMeaning": "我是演员不是模特。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13ff2cd7-5b28-45e0-a9fb-d8439a12a391", "text": "我是用法文写这封信的。", "shortMeaning": "这封信我是用法文写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:326011f2-1e98-41b4-971e-68754ab232b0", "text": "我是穷人，负担不起。", "shortMeaning": "我穷，负担不起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d59508e4-7603-4e8a-a6b9-bbe5c6d0eb34", "text": "我是纯素食者，但我的猫不是。", "shortMeaning": "我吃素，但我的猫不吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65fe5c09-0a55-4de3-988f-effca96d986b", "text": "我是网球俱乐部的会员。", "shortMeaning": "我是网球俱乐部会员。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f103aa54-903c-43ba-b805-6f4ee66d01a2", "text": "我是自学这门语言的。", "shortMeaning": "这门语言我是自学的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22d78725-e630-4f9e-8684-735cf57f0d75", "text": "我是芬兰人，但我也说瑞典语。", "shortMeaning": "我是芬兰人，但也会说瑞典语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98437381-1c8f-42ec-8057-803ba1bd76a8", "text": "我是被外面的交通噪音唤醒的。", "shortMeaning": "我是被外面的交通噪音吵醒的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c8418eb3-c571-44a6-87eb-f6357f8e02e8", "text": "我是该队的领导者。", "shortMeaning": "我是这支队伍的队长。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da45f6dd-ad3f-48a9-af62-ce51ec38868a", "text": "我是语言学专业的。", "shortMeaning": "我读的是语言学专业。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c165e88-113c-4f0f-bfb5-c5bc2e8dd87f", "text": "我是谁？我是诗人。我做什么？我写作。我活得怎么样？我只是活着。", "shortMeaning": "我是谁？我是诗人。做什么？写作。活得怎样？只是活着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6f4f044f-42a9-4457-9073-d09507c6bae4", "text": "我是足球的忠实粉丝。", "shortMeaning": "我是铁杆球迷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b5a0a1e-2f97-48c0-974a-e0288b934251", "text": "我是跑得最快的人。", "shortMeaning": "我跑得最快。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b969a19e-68a5-4673-b7dc-3aa608ff62bd", "text": "我是这么想象出来它的。", "shortMeaning": "我是这样想象出它的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5b6cbea0-351b-4728-a193-fe62ee1c33d4", "text": "我晚上一般很早睡。", "shortMeaning": "我晚上一般很早就睡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83edc780-a137-4322-b77e-59213edffaca", "text": "我晾的衣服被吹走了。", "shortMeaning": "我晾的衣服被风吹走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:063858b0-6627-4cca-89d4-878eb0e1b504", "text": "我暗暗下定决心，下次一定要考好。", "shortMeaning": "我暗下决心，下次一定要考好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c1c8db7-328b-4389-8b6f-1e487b83fd2f", "text": "我更喜欢茶喝咖啡。", "shortMeaning": "比起咖啡我更喜欢茶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08bcdf78-c525-4021-8596-35ae29e91828", "text": "我更想跟你在一起。", "shortMeaning": "我更想和你在一起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9c2636b-5697-47ec-9071-2058ea914058", "text": "我更愿意贫穷而不是富裕。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿贫穷也不富裕。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a189916c-3ec5-488e-b05e-83a5160a3299", "text": "我更愿意走路，而不是骑自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿走路也不骑车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c0c2ec2a-1654-4859-ad5a-a992deeb7c75", "text": "我曾在罗马生活过。", "shortMeaning": "我以前在罗马生活过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07792c5a-7bdd-47f5-8bee-1b5f1dfdeefd", "text": "我曾是世界上最幸福的男人。", "shortMeaning": "我曾是世上最幸福的男人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:28617e66-7acb-4960-99dc-bf21de786548", "text": "我曾经像猪一样吃。", "shortMeaning": "我曾经吃起东西来像猪一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9173abf1-b8ff-4f63-ad4d-aa3b585c45c0", "text": "我曾经在波士顿上学。", "shortMeaning": "我以前在波士顿上学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf3b9184-c8f5-4dcf-9475-e1299808a8f1", "text": "我曾经居住在一个小镇上。", "shortMeaning": "我以前住在一个小镇上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:151abfea-ad15-4fec-b501-d3d1a0a056d0", "text": "我曾经想当天体物理学家。", "shortMeaning": "我曾想当物理学家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a371f5df-2811-4d87-96de-fa99b385fe9b", "text": "我曾说过的废话当中那是最愚蠢的一句。", "shortMeaning": "那是我说过的废话里最蠢的一句。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7e9fb2c-040d-4fb1-821d-7871c51716e3", "text": "我最不感兴趣的城市就是东京。", "shortMeaning": "我最不感兴趣的城市是东京。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:06fc84d1-db63-48ed-8a89-a94706701078", "text": "我最后一刻仍怀疑每一个人。", "shortMeaning": "我直到最后一刻仍怀疑每个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f73e814-8c1d-441b-9ec3-39db7735f0c0", "text": "我最后一次见她是在伦敦。", "shortMeaning": "我最后见她在伦敦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2712a17b-95c0-4ef6-9aaf-0f3fc552acc4", "text": "我最后再给你重复一遍。", "shortMeaning": "我最后再跟你说一遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d46c5b4-f865-4d89-8965-b71d8e7ed084", "text": "我最后还是输了那场官司。", "shortMeaning": "我最终还是输了那场官司。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25f1f35f-7753-432b-9352-b2688112da3b", "text": "我最多只能付每周50美元的房租。", "shortMeaning": "我最多只能付每周五十美元房租。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:28819176-eee1-4c64-8d8f-197d3222d504", "text": "我最好写点别的东西。", "shortMeaning": "我最好写点别的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f336a78-cd2f-4ff3-8755-a63ffa1490e9", "text": "我最好要多层房的三四层楼。", "shortMeaning": "我最好要三四层楼的房子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27070bd1-9737-48dc-95c6-38f764d257a9", "text": "我最终得到了我要的那本书。", "shortMeaning": "我最终得到了想要的那本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74105806-5250-48b5-b08d-314fa081e316", "text": "我最近一直睡眠不足。", "shortMeaning": "我最近一直缺觉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a3d5b738-ef1b-4380-bf92-5f9e023afcf0", "text": "我最近一直都在忙。", "shortMeaning": "我最近一直很忙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:740a7fd7-0ff9-48fa-a230-26582e241a1b", "text": "我最近压力有点大。", "shortMeaning": "我最近压力挺大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e33b6c0b-cea3-4878-aebc-e0d7affb0690", "text": "我最近听说了不少。", "shortMeaning": "我最近听到很多消息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:199263a9-df5e-4bd4-aa37-27519a5187ab", "text": "我最近在朋友的项目里帮忙。", "shortMeaning": "我最近在帮朋友的项目。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11c52449-7a3c-4d8a-adfd-e368facb72cd", "text": "我最近失眠超严重。", "shortMeaning": "我最近失眠特别严重。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a50d6008-81d9-45fe-a0a6-51c050eb44c9", "text": "我最近忙得晕头转向。", "shortMeaning": "我最近忙得团团转。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fe9548e8-cbf1-459b-a370-9be2dcda3424", "text": "我最近有很多事情要做。", "shortMeaning": "我最近有很多事要做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a140ab3-3dc2-4416-af84-0d31d8905a87", "text": "我最近着迷于法语。", "shortMeaning": "我最近迷上了法语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d53f69b-8c1b-4b4f-934b-cf925138b2b5", "text": "我最近经常收到垃圾邮件。", "shortMeaning": "我最近常收到垃圾邮件。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:156668d1-e0a5-48f1-a7df-ddb7bed9ce06", "text": "我最长的爱情是四个月。", "shortMeaning": "我最长的恋爱持续了四个月。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:137b11e5-1151-48e5-a6c4-9943717672ca", "text": "我有一个兄弟和两个姐妹。", "shortMeaning": "我有一个兄弟两个姐妹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98432937-702e-440c-a233-53756d0a9802", "text": "我有一个挺蠢的问题。", "shortMeaning": "我有个挺傻的问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c680b088-074c-4454-9816-bc19b46ea4b1", "text": "我有一个推特账号。", "shortMeaning": "我有个推特账号。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53c91608-0528-4bbe-9c02-b840766010a4", "text": "我有一个经常不带票旅行的朋友。", "shortMeaning": "我有一个常不带票旅行的朋友。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2893d743-1936-467e-9751-baba73868f66", "text": "我有一个问题得问你。", "shortMeaning": "我有个问题要问你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da2e2678-71a5-404e-a30f-af10b84cd4ca", "text": "我有一些东西想从红勘公寓搬到师范大学。", "shortMeaning": "我有东西想从红勘公寓搬到师范大学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0e73860a-42ec-43ea-82ac-9edd9457aad1", "text": "我有一些非常好的消息。", "shortMeaning": "我有些非常好的消息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b0ee4ab-7985-45ef-8c6c-d81a004aac60", "text": "我有一只狗和两只猫。", "shortMeaning": "我养了一只狗两只猫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05cbf5b6-5c94-4c47-ad6e-3ab8dc8af215", "text": "我有一只黑狗和一只白狗。", "shortMeaning": "我养了一只黑狗一只白狗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f926896-a5d8-4644-a31d-785c5031e5b1", "text": "我有一支圆珠笔，可是我还想再要一支。", "shortMeaning": "我有支圆珠笔，但还想再要一支。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9221549-4645-4249-b5de-92ec29cac7c0", "text": "我有一本关于钓鱼的书。", "shortMeaning": "我有本关于钓鱼的书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:59d62ff0-a633-44da-a7fa-43b0ab8ed88e", "text": "我有一种我被忽略了的感觉。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉自己被忽略了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c713b158-d470-479e-a797-1692e65afee6", "text": "我有一辆旧的自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我有辆旧自行车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7bc1f501-b07f-4523-a4d4-4ce260a767c9", "text": "我有一辆红色的自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我有辆红色自行车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3da529b3-f914-45a2-b0fb-d0ec0b3270a1", "text": "我有一间非常大的房子。", "shortMeaning": "我有间很大的房子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16927924-ed63-4d73-81cb-e62260aba72b", "text": "我有一颗无忧无虑的心。", "shortMeaning": "我有颗无忧无虑的心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9a9b250-3d46-4e7d-af98-0af02985960e", "text": "我有三只狗，其中一只是公的，另外两只是母的。", "shortMeaning": "我有三只狗，一公两母。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:21c68182-c447-4e9a-84c4-a73c3a42e0bc", "text": "我有不低于一千片光盘。", "shortMeaning": "我至少有上千张光盘。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b65cc8f6-611e-4b1a-b098-be203524a277", "text": "我有东西想给你看看。", "shortMeaning": "有东西我想给你看看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:50b95765-7633-498f-895c-f0660bda615d", "text": "我有两个兄弟和三个姐妹。", "shortMeaning": "我有两个兄弟三个姐妹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15b8878f-17d2-4a67-ab8b-1f462766e178", "text": "我有两张读卖巨人和中日龙比赛的夜场票，一起去看吧？", "shortMeaning": "我有两张读卖巨人中日龙之战的夜场票，一起去看吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ce035c9-53e7-4591-b2df-b5ddf38b0fce", "text": "我有两把刷成白色的椅子可以送。", "shortMeaning": "我有两把白漆椅子可以送人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e51a6813-013b-42af-9227-1b8f59143c27", "text": "我有两条狗。一条是白色的，另一条是黑色的。", "shortMeaning": "我有两条狗，一条白一条黑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6fb251f5-e5f1-46ab-b128-380b8cd22c5e", "text": "我有个不好的想法。", "shortMeaning": "我有个坏念头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:edaff157-4b83-46b7-b19d-9ed58c3e9da8", "text": "我有个不错的想法。", "shortMeaning": "我有个好主意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c743874c-40d8-4ce4-b8ee-cce70ebed836", "text": "我有个东西您该看看。", "shortMeaning": "有个东西您该看看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:47bf3f62-b31c-4507-af59-fba2ad95f169", "text": "我有个阿姨住在洛杉矶。", "shortMeaning": "我有个姑妈住在洛杉矶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c16161f-19d1-4ec9-9140-680c66899f59", "text": "我有了一个新主意。", "shortMeaning": "我想到个新主意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5e5c9d2-04bf-4144-9017-0a0cba3f1830", "text": "我有些东西要给你。", "shortMeaning": "我有些东西给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3138f244-9590-44ed-9d86-78a4c68267a3", "text": "我有些年没见过他了。", "shortMeaning": "我好些年没见过他了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e078e90c-2f87-4950-85b5-d1b5f1d0bdfe", "text": "我有什么别的选择？", "shortMeaning": "我还有什么别的选择？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40aacf09-be13-441b-8230-643497eb353d", "text": "我有什么能避免发生在我身上的坏事的方法吗？", "shortMeaning": "我有什么办法能避免坏事发生吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1b0d2b0-e55a-4848-bdae-76a8f39e08a8", "text": "我有大量的书在我的书架上。", "shortMeaning": "我书架上有很多书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7fe4ebe7-54eb-4920-8cc5-13dbfff65f4c", "text": "我有好久都没烤面包了。要不今天烤点儿？", "shortMeaning": "我好久没烤面包了，要不今天烤点？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7df9924d-c106-40de-99e6-234caf3face6", "text": "我有很多事情要做。", "shortMeaning": "我有很多事要做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c0581b2-bd5a-47d1-ab27-291da2661e92", "text": "我有很多朋友帮我。", "shortMeaning": "有很多朋友帮我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19aefe03-2630-4622-aaef-6e2a69363769", "text": "我有很重要的事情要跟你说。", "shortMeaning": "我有很重要的事要跟你说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c2cee17d-d20f-4329-b233-5dd09e0c3353", "text": "我有必要向他解释原因吗？", "shortMeaning": "我需要向他解释原因吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6abc34a9-8b2d-4f1c-b0d8-39c5ef99a8d3", "text": "我有志成为一名律师。", "shortMeaning": "我有志成为律师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b0192e6-0009-4017-92ce-9ce944a38eb5", "text": "我有我需要的所有东西。", "shortMeaning": "我有我需要的一切。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a0f146c-f3b3-490f-987e-b59abdf8a1e8", "text": "我有手写笔记的习惯，但依然经常提笔忘字。", "shortMeaning": "我有手写笔记的习惯，却仍常提笔忘字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:57e4e2c7-1e84-4f27-bc09-db1bd99e6cf1", "text": "我有时候打破规矩。", "shortMeaning": "我有时会破例。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2bd40579-34ef-4ab5-a600-1dda2be28731", "text": "我有时早上不想下床。", "shortMeaning": "我有时早晨不想起床。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b1cb627-5802-4b51-b046-b9a4422a639b", "text": "我有没有问过你，你会说镇江话吗？", "shortMeaning": "我有没有问过你会不会说镇江话？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34874f94-3068-4c33-aaf2-45f3fdca7905", "text": "我有点不能集中注意力。", "shortMeaning": "我有点难以集中注意力。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0cc23255-00ca-43c9-83e0-39c09f39c7c2", "text": "我有点感冒，没能和家人一起去指宿。", "shortMeaning": "我有点感冒，没能和家人去指宿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e1d01eb1-93b6-46aa-96c2-8eb8b3a10621", "text": "我有的，但是没带来。", "shortMeaning": "我有，但没带来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7aec121-71e7-48cf-8b38-51bd160cffcd", "text": "我有空带你去踏青。", "shortMeaning": "有空我带你去郊游。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5203d31-700e-480f-8637-fcb74203a7f9", "text": "我有钱的话，我就买这台电脑。", "shortMeaning": "有钱的话我就买这台电脑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e6c7e66-8fd0-411a-ad4f-bf566eb4ffac", "text": "我有问题，就像其他人一样。", "shortMeaning": "我和其他人一样也有问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebcfcf0d-59bd-47b1-8dba-5095635ae913", "text": "我期待听到你在这件事上的想法 。", "shortMeaning": "我期待听到你对这件事的想法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bb41f606-b31b-4209-984e-b8e107ef1f9a", "text": "我期待在波士顿见你们。", "shortMeaning": "我盼着在波士顿见到你们。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16b31ce1-62a7-4fe6-8d15-c777f531eecd", "text": "我期待很快就能收到你的信。", "shortMeaning": "我期待很快收到你的信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d09ade0b-c3d6-4e10-a75e-8f2fd579aa5e", "text": "我期望能在圣诞节见到你。", "shortMeaning": "我期望在圣诞节见到你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e897359c-737e-46b5-a854-7c0cb34ff716", "text": "我本不该告诉您什么的。", "shortMeaning": "我本不该告诉您什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64f255e9-eb63-4365-b379-90e915b2fdfa", "text": "我本以为他会更聪明一些。", "shortMeaning": "我本以为他会更聪明些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3ef6879-77ea-4742-9137-6b4b3d76ef16", "text": "我本想去参加音乐会的。", "shortMeaning": "我本想去听音乐会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:86f0ae03-a805-49b0-99fa-d2f5f63c76eb", "text": "我本打算跟她一起去，可是我太忙了。", "shortMeaning": "我本想跟她一起去，但太忙了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2848bd6d-c1d3-4779-8ea9-7b6b2471ffc8", "text": "我本来什么也不知道啊！", "shortMeaning": "我本来什么都不知道啊！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b08c9f3b-1006-4840-bc99-d5d41407c1eb", "text": "我本来很想走走，但是天太热了。", "shortMeaning": "我本很想走走，但天太热了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:66273611-a0e1-47c6-92d0-267aa2e5166b", "text": "我本来想给她打电话的，结果忘了。", "shortMeaning": "我本想给她打电话，结果忘了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c5257578-af42-4ad7-bb15-45d58ddefabf", "text": "我本来想给我在公园发现的松鼠拍照，但它太敏捷了，因此我拍的照片都不好。", "shortMeaning": "我本想给公园里的松鼠拍照，但它太敏捷，照片都没拍好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05cc3757-2c81-4465-ac00-b5f4a308e139", "text": "我本来想走的，但后来忘了。", "shortMeaning": "我本想走的，但后来忘了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de285033-53e3-4c84-a878-cbceaaf12353", "text": "我本来打算搭这辆公共汽车，但是很拥挤。", "shortMeaning": "我本想搭这辆公交，但太挤了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1728b372-a88f-4dbb-a785-c8b8ccbb8d7b", "text": "我本来预备今天去海滩的，但接着天就开始下雨了。", "shortMeaning": "我本打算今天去海滩，可接着就下雨了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa4037a6-b42f-4928-8248-2198e5328f4e", "text": "我本该在买下这个电动剃须刀之前试一下的。", "shortMeaning": "我本该在买电动剃须刀前试一下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5936fe59-8e3f-44f7-afbb-fcab3ee3af57", "text": "我来帮你把应用软件干脆统统调掉。", "shortMeaning": "我来帮你把应用软件统统卸载掉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:673976a5-513d-4f46-b4e0-086d195a2c9d", "text": "我来承担失败的责任。", "shortMeaning": "失败的责任我来担。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec7dd83e-fa99-4354-bf58-b12284c91fa6", "text": "我来拿去再把它煮一下。", "shortMeaning": "我拿去再煮一下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:802d505e-6c4e-45d6-9dbb-33d6410f5a8c", "text": "我来自一个美丽的城市-成都。", "shortMeaning": "我来自美丽的城市成都。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d888b694-ec36-4e55-961d-b165e65a2f3c", "text": "我来警告你别那样做。", "shortMeaning": "我来提醒你别那么做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba530a3f-7704-4c18-a2fb-563ab42d17ce", "text": "我来跟你们介绍一下。", "shortMeaning": "我来给你们介绍一下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dcc18eee-88ea-4c4e-9917-2ca5a4dfb492", "text": "我来问个有点傻的问题。", "shortMeaning": "我问个有点傻的问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf534e4f-7ea9-4a53-9980-08210646c161", "text": "我校图书馆藏书二百五十万册。", "shortMeaning": "我校图书馆藏书250万册。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95a7b97e-9cf0-44e8-a27c-a71e81e98a73", "text": "我根本不在乎我的简历。", "shortMeaning": "我完全不在乎简历。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:087c5bda-5cad-4145-af98-14664da8b6e6", "text": "我根本不把你放在眼里！", "shortMeaning": "我根本不把你放眼里！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fc42e695-23b0-4e0b-a49a-a4640d4aef6a", "text": "我根本不认识这位女士。", "shortMeaning": "这位女士我根本不认识。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f21a8e0b-0fd1-4905-b26e-440b0ab33694", "text": "我根本不需要这个。", "shortMeaning": "我根本用不着这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e946dd05-57d4-4a1c-b19a-c129df21c6d1", "text": "我桌上的电话一直大声响铃。", "shortMeaning": "我桌上的电话一直响。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c21b8238-f2d2-4cde-b1b6-c7ce355fe71f", "text": "我梦到宝宝在玩刀。", "shortMeaning": "我梦见宝宝在玩刀。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3033c69-f43c-42c0-b9f2-481f059b204e", "text": "我正准备打电话给你。", "shortMeaning": "我正准备给你打电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1376b1d7-3122-4774-bf25-7055306e824d", "text": "我正在为今晚做预约。", "shortMeaning": "我正在为今晚预订。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4103653-4ee4-4d23-91db-119561ae19d3", "text": "我正在为我的妈妈寻找礼物。", "shortMeaning": "我正在为妈妈挑礼物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29fd2c0e-d611-49e3-b24e-478ffc0a49db", "text": "我正在准备明天的数学考试。", "shortMeaning": "我在准备明天的数学考试。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:869b4f3d-b9b9-4e40-92e5-e64680252035", "text": "我正在去第四医院的路上。", "shortMeaning": "我在去第四医院的路上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c2031005-301a-46e5-aaea-dfd440fbc7c1", "text": "我正在在波士顿读博士。", "shortMeaning": "我正在波士顿读博士。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c5ffc3a3-4ffe-47fd-b246-562cfaddf657", "text": "我正在大学里读经济。", "shortMeaning": "我在大学读经济。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04266ec4-2d06-45e7-b1ad-7bfeb7d3766b", "text": "我正在学两门外语。", "shortMeaning": "我在学两门外语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8219e31c-456d-423a-bc5f-825fa5a930ed", "text": "我正在开发一个安卓应用。", "shortMeaning": "我在开发一个安卓应用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:373648e8-3340-4cfe-91f8-db5858830756", "text": "我正在我的房间里祈祷。", "shortMeaning": "我在我的房间里祈祷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee89c917-d531-494c-a4bc-65e423e748a2", "text": "我正在找钥匙，你看见了吗？", "shortMeaning": "我在找钥匙，你看见了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:379ece54-b103-45cf-ba7f-c7414601d22e", "text": "我正在把这个机器人的消息从英语翻译成匈牙利语。", "shortMeaning": "我在把这个机器人的消息从英语译成匈牙利语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1f7621f0-2003-4956-945d-8ecbf4f6edd3", "text": "我正在用一台新电脑。", "shortMeaning": "我在用一台新电脑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3521fe4b-bd3a-4b4a-a5e5-2dd3e861010e", "text": "我正在用手机打电话。", "shortMeaning": "我在用手机打电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f6c96e76-8ca8-43a6-81bc-aa5ce9aff478", "text": "我正在试着学英语。", "shortMeaning": "我在试着学英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1b7d3e0-f9f8-4cf5-bc0d-0c7192f35a19", "text": "我正在追踪一头公鹿。", "shortMeaning": "我在追踪一头公鹿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fc1f0303-fe4d-4af6-86db-969d4bcbb7cd", "text": "我正好5点到达了山顶。", "shortMeaning": "我正好五点到达山顶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cbd55168-9892-4a9c-84ed-d54616d01216", "text": "我正存钱出国留学。", "shortMeaning": "我在攒钱出国留学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d57c1555-e4e6-4113-b44d-3a24b0137c13", "text": "我正打算去洛杉矶。", "shortMeaning": "我正准备去洛杉矶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77a05af6-5ecd-4188-9ea3-e57e246aa83d", "text": "我正看着那些你给我寄来的信呢。", "shortMeaning": "我正看着你给我寄来的信呢。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94a815cb-da91-4562-a0ec-f115db1a4e3d", "text": "我正要去写一封信。", "shortMeaning": "我正要去写封信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7c60956-d08c-4c50-9be2-ed9539e639c2", "text": "我正要离开家的时候电话响了。", "shortMeaning": "我正要出门时电话响了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6862699b-9199-4d2f-bf75-f102500fcb95", "text": "我母亲不会骑自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我妈不会骑车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d01a0571-4644-41d5-b66c-dc5833e4bf1c", "text": "我母亲买了两瓶橙汁。", "shortMeaning": "我妈买了两瓶橙汁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b9b0aab7-06cf-48f3-a5e8-90ee01efb8e7", "text": "我母亲会说五种语言。", "shortMeaning": "我妈会说五种语言。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:593ee784-c9ae-4a93-9b3a-b760be2ba797", "text": "我母亲宁愿选彩票机上的任意数字，也不选我的幸运数字。", "shortMeaning": "我母亲宁可选彩票机的数字，也不选我的幸运数字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e052de4-da75-4507-a262-339f27ff47f0", "text": "我母亲已经五十岁了。", "shortMeaning": "我妈五十岁了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4edeb974-28fc-4f5b-ad6a-58aaf47deb8f", "text": "我母亲是个奇特的人。", "shortMeaning": "我妈是个奇怪的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b22cabb-8de9-40dc-9f52-7a255945ff74", "text": "我母亲有驾照，但是她不开车。", "shortMeaning": "我母亲有驾照但不开车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e67dd9d2-bc49-4b26-b058-de51c8eb2f36", "text": "我母亲比我父亲大两岁。", "shortMeaning": "我妈比我爸大两岁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbfc977a-31b5-4425-aeaa-bc185275c26d", "text": "我母亲病得很严重。", "shortMeaning": "我妈病得很重。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3cb1b444-29a2-4a44-adef-4afaeb8c17e0", "text": "我母亲的法语比我父亲的英语要好，所以他们通常用法语交流。", "shortMeaning": "我妈法语比我爸英语好，所以他们通常用法语交流。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6299f15-4549-4d5d-a69f-e108917be474", "text": "我每三个月献一次血。", "shortMeaning": "我每三月献一次血。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e6e1bd7-34bc-4756-99c6-2475945c4f5b", "text": "我每个周末早上工作三小时。", "shortMeaning": "我每周末早上干三小时。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f1b9ec0-901a-4a16-a12f-a2f0642ff8f1", "text": "我每周去游一次泳。", "shortMeaning": "我每周游一次泳。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5bdee1e8-cbbd-4068-89cf-eb7124b7f574", "text": "我每周末都会去市区。", "shortMeaning": "我每周末都去市区。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:57f81f0d-b7f1-46e6-ad44-373f6596c780", "text": "我每周都去看电影。", "shortMeaning": "我每周都看电影。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e6a02d11-2eff-4b07-a694-6dc8e6ee2260", "text": "我每天乘电车去办公室。", "shortMeaning": "我每天坐电车去办公室。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c1fc7b2-33f2-4f3f-9314-44519ec7d51a", "text": "我每天六点钟起床。", "shortMeaning": "我每天六点起床。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:10f5465b-6987-4db8-bba0-73fb526710cc", "text": "我每天学习英语一个小时。", "shortMeaning": "我每天学一小时英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d12dd2ea-3510-41ca-82ef-d1b45be9e6d2", "text": "我每天早上6点叫醒他。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早上六点叫醒他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b5c4f66-db02-4604-ac3a-1e9a3fbc48a8", "text": "我每天早上8点之前离开家。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早上八点前出门。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c70b8578-5c1e-4885-9507-07466fb4dd0f", "text": "我每天早上七点起床。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早上七点起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebe82bdd-4c11-431e-8917-5a50908c0a53", "text": "我每天早上六点起床。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早上六点起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:820f390e-b7b4-4a06-abfe-2ed1569811d1", "text": "我每天早上刮胡子。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早晨刮胡子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b34caa2-a714-45bb-95ba-3e3972f7fd0e", "text": "我每天早上到公园里遛狗。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早上去公园遛狗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a13b7d1-1508-4dab-8986-0956758cc3d4", "text": "我每天早上都去买东西。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早上都购物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:117de64f-a979-4b58-a96b-3884dce847ab", "text": "我每天早上都读报纸。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早上读报。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8fb653de-3cfe-4659-a1cf-85a4e822bb7e", "text": "我每天早晨吃一碗麦片粥。", "shortMeaning": "我每天早晨喝碗麦片粥。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:340f23e9-9e04-4b9f-a8eb-38bcfdd9f28d", "text": "我每天都从那座教堂前经过。", "shortMeaning": "我每天从那座教堂前经过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb253599-eb69-4b4f-852b-199fba8ba508", "text": "我每天都是这样安慰自己。", "shortMeaning": "我每天都这样安慰自己。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9762c0c-a9f9-4091-8d0d-c40c1d12c66b", "text": "我每天都给他打电话。", "shortMeaning": "我每天给他打电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f30a9dd7-3a87-451c-b61a-12984d8a6cab", "text": "我每年7月4号都会来这里。", "shortMeaning": "我每年七月四号都来这里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c550226-6880-41c6-852b-1b4826255f4b", "text": "我每年必须来这里。", "shortMeaning": "我每年都得来这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:718b42b8-248e-4bc3-934a-dc848bbe88c2", "text": "我每年拜访我父亲两次。", "shortMeaning": "我每年探望父亲两次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42fddbbd-a5a7-4af3-ae32-f7cc651b691e", "text": "我每年接受一次全面体检。", "shortMeaning": "我每年做一次全面体检。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbe340cd-68de-4a1a-a8f1-fbd97230334e", "text": "我每时每刻都在为你而活。", "shortMeaning": "我每时每刻都为你而活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e318fd46-2537-4c47-9b8e-1eaf2d6f1545", "text": "我每晚都听收音机。", "shortMeaning": "我每天晚上听收音机。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf9f1985-e179-473a-ab18-e2849409535c", "text": "我每次去他家，他都不在家。", "shortMeaning": "我每次去他家他都不在。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5335c0b8-9f1d-4fc4-a694-e4024bd35aa8", "text": "我每次去巴黎，都会去圣心大教堂，坐在台阶上，听下面的人唱歌、弹琴。", "shortMeaning": "我每次去巴黎都去圣心大教堂，坐台阶上听人唱歌弹琴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:80663bbc-0c00-4939-9e91-9641853e3d42", "text": "我每次听这首歌都会听到哭。", "shortMeaning": "我每次听这首歌都会哭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8efe0061-8770-4d88-9484-40bc9c332f55", "text": "我每次看这部电影都会哭。", "shortMeaning": "我每次看这电影都哭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
